  "question": {
    "text": "What will be the displacement equation of the simple harmonic motion obtained by combining the motions?<br />\r<math><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>ω</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>ω</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>ω</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math>"
  },
